                <pb facs="0358" n="350" sameAs="frus:frus1941v07/pg350"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/4356: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">White</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-10-01">October 1, 1941</date>.<lb/>[Received 3:08
                        p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>186. Executive agreement of September 13, 1941 to replace the accord of August 7,
                    1933 is due to enter into force today at 4 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
